hadiths[55]{hadithnumber,text}:
"370","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) kehtey they: Musalman jab Madina aey to jama hotey aur namaz key waqt ka andaza kartey, uskey liye pukaara na jaata tha. To unhon-ne aik din uskey baarey mein baat ki. To baaz ne kaha: Nasaara key naaqoos jaisa naaqoos bana lo. Aur baaz ne kaha: Balke Yahood key seeng jaisa bigul. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kya tum aadmi na bhejogey jo namaz key liye pukaarey? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Bilaal! Utho aur namaz key liye pukaaro. (Bukhari: 604)"
"371","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Bilaal ko hukm diya gaya ke wo azaan dohra kar kahein aur iqaamat taaq kahein, iqaamat key siwa. (Bukhari: 605)"
"372","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz key liye pukaara jaata hai to shaitaan peeth mor kar bhaagta hai jabke usey (hawa khaarij honay ki) aawaaz aati hai yahan tak ke wo azaan na suney. Phir jab pukaar poori ho jaati hai to wapas aata hai. Yahan tak ke jab namaz key liye iqaamat kahi jaati hai to peeth mor kar bhaagta hai. Yahan tak ke jab iqaamat poori ho jaati hai to wapas aata hai. Yahan tak ke aadmi aur uskey dil key darmiyaan waswasa daalta hai, kehta hai: Fulaan yaad karo, fulaan yaad karo, jo wo yaad na karta tha. Yahan tak ke aadmi reh jaata hai aur nahi jaanta ke us ne kitni padhi. (Bukhari: 608)"
"373","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak moazzin ki aawaaz ki door tak jinn aur insaan aur koi cheez nahi sunti magar Qiyaamat key din uskey liye gawahi degi. (Bukhari: 609)"
"374","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab hamaarey sath qaum par hamla kartey to hamarey sath subah honay se pehley hamla na kartey aur dekhtey. Phir agar azaan suntey to un se ruk jaatey aur agar azaan na suntey to un par hamla kartey. (Bukhari: 610)"
"375","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum pukaar suno to waisa kaho jaisa moazzin kehta hai. (Bukhari: 611)"
"376","[AI-translation] Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se us jaisa (marwi hai) uskey qaul (aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain) tak. Aur jab us ne kaha: Namaz ki taraf aao, to unhon-ne kaha: Allah key siwa koi taaqat aur quwwat nahi. Aur kaha: Ham ne tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa kehtey huey suna hai. (Bukhari: 612-613)"
"377","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo pukaar suntey waqt kahey: Ae Allah! Is poori daawat aur qaem honay wali namaz key Rab! Muhammad ko waseela aur fazeelat dey aur unhey Maqaam-e-Mehmood par bhej jis ka tune un se waada kya hai. To uskey liye Qiyaamat key din meri shafaat halaal ho jaati hai. (Bukhari: 614)"
"378","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar log jaantey ke pukaar aur pehli saf mein kya hai, phir use qura andaazi key siwa na paatey to us par qura andaazi kartey. Aur agar jaantey ke dopahar (ki namaz key liye jaldi aaney) mein kya hai to uski taraf daudtey. Aur agar jaantey ke Isha aur Subah mein kya hai to un donon mein aatey agarchey ghisat kar. (Bukhari: 615)"
"379","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Bilaal raat mein azaan kehta hai. To khaao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktoom pukaarey. Phir kaha: Aur wo naabeena aadmi they, pukaartey na they yahan tak ke un se kaha jaata: Tum ne subah ki, tum ne subah ki. (Bukhari: 617)"
"380","[AI-translation] Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Subah key liye moazzin azaan kehta aur Subah zaahir hoti to namaz khadi honay se pehley do halki rakatein padhtey. (Bukhari: 618)"
"381","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko Bilaal ki azaan apni sehri se na rokey. Beshak wo raat mein azaan kehta hai ya pukaarta hai taake tumhara khada honay wala wapas aa jaey aur tumhara sonay wala jaag jaey. Aur ye nahi ke Fajr ya Subah kehta hai. Aur Aap ne apni ungliyon se (ishaara) kya aur unhey upar uthaaya aur neechey jhukaaya yahan tak ke aisa kaha. Zuhair ne kaha: Apni donon shahaadat ki ungliyon se, aik doosri key upar, phir use apne daaen aur baaen phailaaya. (Bukhari: 621)"
"382","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mughaffal Muzani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har do azaanon key darmiyaan namaz hai, teen martaba, jo chaahaaey (uskey liye). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Har do azaanon key darmiyaan namaz hai, har do azaanon key darmiyaan namaz hai. Phir teesri mein farmaya: Jo chaahaaey (uskey liye). (Bukhari: 624 aur 627)"
"383","[AI-translation] Maalik bin Huwairis (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main apni qaum key aik giroh mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur ham Aap key paas bees raatein thehrey. Aur Aap meherbaan naram they. Phir jab Aap ne apne ghar walon ki taraf hamaara shauq dekha to farmaya: Wapas jao aur un mein raho aur unhey sikhaao aur namaz padho. Phir jab namaz ka waqt aaey to tum mein se koi tumhey azaan kahey aur tum mein bada tumhey imamat karaaey. (Bukhari: 628)"
"384","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Maalik Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai: Do aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey jabke wo safar ka iraada rakhtey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum niklo to azaan kaho phir iqaamat kaho, phir tum mein bada tumhey imamat karaaey. (Bukhari: 630)"
"385","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) moazzin ko hukm detey ke wo azaan kahey. Phir uskey peechey kehtey: Khabardaar! Rehalon mein namaz padho. Thandi ya baarish wali raat mein safar mein. (Bukhari: 632)"
"386","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namaz padh rahey they ke Aap ne aadmiyon key shor ki aawaaz suni. Phir jab Aap ne namaz padhi to farmaya: Tumhara kya haal hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham namaz ki taraf jaldi mein aey. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo. Jab tum namaz key liye aao to tum par sukoon laazim hai. To jo tum paao padho aur jo tum se faut ho jaey use poora karo. (Bukhari: 635)"
"387","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Qataada Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz key liye iqaamat kahi jaey to khadey na ho yahan tak ke tum mujhey dekho. (Bukhari: 637)"
"388","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Namaz key liye iqaamat kahi gai jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid key pehlu mein aik aadmi se sargoshi kar rahey they. To Aap namaz key liye na uthay yahan tak ke qaum so gai. (Bukhari: 642)"
"389","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak main ne iraada kya ke lakdi ka hukm dun aur lakdi jama ki jaey, phir namaz ka hukm dun aur uskey liye azaan kahi jaey, phir aadmi ka hukm dun aur wo logon ko imamat karaaey, phir aadmiyon ki taraf jaaun aur un par unkey ghar jalaa dun. Aur qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar un mein se koi jaanta ke wo moti haddi ya do achhi sirri paaeyga to Isha mein zaroor haazir hota. (Bukhari: 644)"
"390","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jamaat ki namaz akeley ki namaz par sattaees darjey fazeelat rakhti hai. (Bukhari: 645)"
"391","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jamaat ki namaz tum mein se kisi ki akeley namaz par pachees hisson se fazeelat rakhti hai. Aur raat key farishtey aur din key farishtey Fajr ki namaz mein jama hotey hain. Phir Abu Hurairah kehtey hain: To padho agar chaaaho: (Beshak Fajr ka Quran haazir kya gaya hai). (Bukhari: 648)"
"392","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz mein ajr mein sab se badey log wo hain jo sab se door, phir door chaltey hain. Aur jo namaz ka intezaar karta hai yahan tak ke use Imam key sath padhey wo us se badey ajr wala hai jo namaz padhey phir so jaey. (Bukhari: 651)"
"393","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jabke aik aadmi raastey mein chal raha tha ke us ne raastey mein kaantey ki shaakh paai. To use hata diya. To Allah ne uska shukr ada kya aur usey maaf kar diya. (Bukhari: 652)"
"394","[AI-translation] Phir farmaya: Shaheed paanch hain: Taoon mein marney wala aur pet (ki beemaari) mein marney wala aur doobney wala aur malbey key neechey dab kar marney wala aur Allah key raastey mein shaheed. (Bukhari: 653)"
"395","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munaafiqon par Fajr aur Isha se bhaari koi namaz nahi hai. Aur agar wo jaantey ke un donon mein kya hai to un donon mein aatey agarchey ghisat kar. (Bukhari: 657)"
"396","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Saat (qism key log) hain jinhey Allah apne saaey mein rakhega jis din uskey saaey key siwa koi saaya na hoga: Aadil Imam. Aur jawan jo apne Rab ki ibaadat mein pala badha. Aur aadmi jiska dil masjidon mein atka hua hai. Aur do aadmi jinhon-ne Allah key liye mohabbat ki, us par jama huey aur us par juda huey. Aur aadmi jisey martabey aur husn wali aurat ne (buraai ki taraf) bulaaya to us ne kaha: Beshak main Allah se darta hun. Aur aadmi jis ne sadqa diya aur chhupaaya yahan tak ke uska baayaan (haath) na jaaney ke uska daayaan (haath) kya kharch karta hai. Aur aadmi jis ne tanhai mein Allah ko yaad kya aur uski aankhein behnein lagein. (Bukhari: 660)"
"397","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo subah masjid ki taraf gaya aur shaam ko gaya to Allah uskey liye Jannat mein uski mehmaani tayyaar karega jab bhi wo subah ya shaam jaey. (Bukhari: 662)"
"398","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Maalik bin Buhaina (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi ko dekha jabke namaz key liye iqaamat kahi jaa chuki thi, wo do rakatein padh raha tha. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) phirey to log uskey gird jama huey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Subah chaar (rakatein)? Subah chaar (rakatein)? (Bukhari: 663)"
"399","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne us marz mein beemaar huey jis mein Aap faut huey aur namaz ka waqt aaya aur azaan kahi gai. To Aap ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz padhaaey. To Aap se kaha gaya: Beshak Abu Bakr naram dil aadmi hain, jab Aap key maqaam mein khadey hongey to logon ko namaz na padha saken ge. Aur Aap ne dohraaya to unhon-ne Aap key liye dohraaya. To Aap ne teesri martaba dohraaya aur farmaya: Beshak tum Yusuf ki saheliyaan ho. Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz padhaaey. To Abu Bakr nikley aur namaz padhaai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne aap mein halka pan paaya aur do aadmiyon key darmiyaan sahara liye huey nikley goya main Aap key donon paon dekh rahi hun jo dard se zameen mein ghisat rahey they. To Abu Bakr ne peechey hatna chaaha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf ishaara kya ke apni jagah (raho). Phir Aap ko laaya gaya yahan tak ke Aap unkey pehlu mein baithey. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz padhtey they aur Abu Bakr Aapki namaz key sath namaz padhtey they aur log Abu Bakr ki namaz key sath namaz padhtey they. To unhon-ne apne sar se kaha: Haan. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Aap Abu Bakr key baaen taraf baithey. To Abu Bakr khadey ho kar namaz padhtey they. (Bukhari: 664)"
"400","[AI-translation] Aur Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bojh badh gaya aur Aap ka dard sakht ho gaya to Aap ne apni biwiyon se ijazat maangi ke Aap merey ghar mein teemaardaari mein rahein. To unhon-ne Aap ko ijazat dey di. Aur baaqi hadees qareeb guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 665)"
"401","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne keechad waley din khutba diya. To moazzin ko hukm diya jab wo Hayya alas Salaah tak pahuncha ke kaho: Rehalon mein namaz padho. To baaz ne baaz ki taraf dekha goya unhon-ne inkaar kya. To unhon-ne kaha: Goya tum ne iska inkaar kya hai. Beshak ye us ne kya jo mujh se behtar tha, yaani Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). Beshak wo azimat (ka hukm) hai. Aur beshak main ne naapasand kya ke tumhey tang karun. (Bukhari: 668)"
"402","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Beshak main tumharey sath namaz nahi padh sakta. Aur wo mote jism wala aadmi tha. To us ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye khaana banaaya aur Aap ko apne ghar bulaaya. To Aap key liye chaataai bichhaai aur chaataai key kinaarey par paani chhidka. To Aap ne us par do rakatein padhein. To Aal-e-Jaarood mein se aik aadmi ne Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Chaasht padhtey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko use padhtey huey nahi dekha magar us din. (Bukhari: 670)"
"403","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab raat ka khaana pesh kar diya jaey to Maghrib ki namaz padhney se pehley us se shuru karo. Aur apne raat key khaaney se jaldi na karo. (Bukhari: 672). Nafe se Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi khaaney par ho to jaldi na karey yahan tak ke us se apni haajat poori kar ley, agarchey namaz key liye iqaamat kahi jaey. (674). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"404","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ghar mein kya kartey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo apne ghar walon key kaam mein hotey, yaani apne ghar walon ki khidmat. Phir jab namaz ka waqt aata to namaz key liye nikaltey. (Bukhari: 676)"
"405","[AI-translation] Maalik bin Huwairis (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main tumhey namaz padhaata hun aur namaz ka iraada nahi rakhta. Main namaz padhta hun jaisa main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko namaz padhtey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 677)"
"406","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Abu Bakr ko logon ko namaz padhaanay key hukm ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Beshak Abu Bakr jab Aap key maqaam mein khadey hongey to roney ki wajah se logon ko suna na saken ge. To Umar ko hukm dijiye ke wo logon ko namaz padhaaey. To Aisha ne kaha: To main ne Hafsa se kaha: Un se kaho ke beshak Abu Bakr jab Aap key maqaam mein khadey hongey to roney ki wajah se logon ko suna na saken ge. To Umar ko hukm dijiye ke wo logon ko namaz padhaaey. To Hafsa ne aisa kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bas karo! Beshak tum Yusuf ki saheliyaan ho. Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke wo logon ko namaz padhaaey. To Hafsa ne Aisha se kaha: Mujhey tum se kabhi bhalai nahi milni thi. (Bukhari: 679)"
"407","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key us marz mein jis mein Aap faut huey unhey namaz padhaatey they. Yahan tak ke jab Peer ka din tha jabke wo namaz mein safein baandhey huey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hujrey ka parda khola aur hamein dekhney lagey jabke Aap khadey they. Goya Aap ka chehra Quran ka waraq hai. Phir Aap hansey aur muskuraye. To ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekhney ki khushi se fitney mein padney ka iraada kya. To Abu Bakr aidiyon par wapas hatey taake saf mein mil jaaein aur gumaan kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz key liye nikal rahey hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ishaara kya ke apni namaz poori karo. Aur parda gira diya. To Aap usi din faut ho gaey. (Bukhari: 680)"
"408","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad Saaedi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bani Amr bin Auf ki taraf gaey taake unkey darmiyaan sulah karaaein. To namaz ka waqt aa gaya. To moazzin Abu Bakr key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Kya tum logon ko namaz padhaaogey to main iqaamat kahun? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. To Abu Bakr ne namaz padhaai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aey jabke log namaz mein they. To Aap rasta bana kar saf mein khadey huey aur logon ne taali bajaai. Aur Abu Bakr apni namaz mein tawajjoh na kartey they. Phir jab logon ne taali bahut bajaai to tawajjoh ki aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf ishaara kya ke apni jagah raho. To Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apney haath uthaaey aur Allah ki hamd ki us par jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey uska hukm diya tha. Phir Abu Bakr peechey hatey yahan tak ke saf mein baraabar ho gaey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aagey badhey aur namaz padhaai. Phir jab Aap phirey to farmaya: Ae Abu Bakr! Tumhey thaharne se kis ne roka jab main ne tumhey hukm diya tha? To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ibn Abi Quhaafa key liye na tha ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key saamney namaz padhaaey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey kya hua ke main ne tumhey taali bahut bajaatey huey dekha? Jo uski namaz mein koi baat pesh aaey to use SubhanAllah kehna chaahiye. Beshak jab wo SubhanAllah kahega to uski taraf tawajjoh ki jaaeygi. Aur taali bajana auraton key liye hai. (Bukhari: 684)"
"409","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bojh badh gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz padhi? Ham ne kaha: Nahi, wo tumhara intezaar kar rahey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Merey liye lagan mein paani rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham ne aisa kya aur Aap ne ghusl kya. To Aap uthney chaley to Aap par behoshi chha gai. Phir Aap hosh mein aey aur farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz padhi? Ham ne kaha: Nahi, wo tumhara intezaar kar rahey hain Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Merey liye lagan mein paani rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap baithey aur ghusl kya. Phir Aap uthney chaley to Aap par behoshi chha gai. Phir Aap hosh mein aey aur farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz padhi? Ham ne kaha: Nahi, wo tumhara intezaar kar rahey hain Ya Rasulullah! To Aap ne farmaya: Merey liye lagan mein paani rakkho. To Aap baithey aur ghusl kya, phir uthney chaley to Aap par behoshi chha gai. Phir Aap hosh mein aey aur farmaya: Kya logon ne namaz padhi? To ham ne kaha: Nahi, wo tumhara intezaar kar rahey hain Ya Rasulullah! Aur log masjid mein thehrey huey they, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka aakhri Isha key liye intezaar kar rahey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu Bakr ki taraf bheja ke wo logon ko namaz padhaaey. To Aap ka bheja hua uskey paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey hukm detey hain ke tum logon ko namaz padhaao. To Abu Bakr ne jo naram dil aadmi they kaha: Ae Umar! Logon ko namaz padhaao. To Umar ne un se kaha: Tum uskey zyada haqdaar ho. To Abu Bakr ne un dinon namaz padhaai. (Bukhari: 687)"
"410","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki apne ghar mein beemaari ki haalat mein namaz ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: Phir jab wo baith kar namaz padhey to baith kar namaz padho. (Bukhari: 688)"
"411","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kehtey: Allah uski sunta hai jo uski hamd karta hai, to ham mein se koi apni peeth na jhukaata yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajdey mein padtey, phir ham uskey baad sajdey mein padtey. (Bukhari: 690)"
"412","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi nahi darta ya kya tum mein se koi nahi darta ke jab wo Imam se pehley apna sar uthaaey to Allah uska sar gadhey ka sar bana dey ya Allah uski soorat gadhey ki soorat bana dey. (Bukhari: 691)"
"413","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Suno aur itaat karo agarchey tum par Habshi (ghulaam) muqarrar kar diya jaey jiska sar munakkey jaisa ho. (Bukhari: 693)"
"414","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo tumhey namaz padhaatey hain. Phir agar wo durust karein to tumharey liye hai. Aur agar wo ghalti karein to tumharey liye hai aur un par hai. (Bukhari: 694)"
"415","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se unkey apni khaala key ghar raat guzaarney ki hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein farmaya: Phir soey yahan tak ke kharraatey liye, aur Aap jab sotey to kharraatey letey. Phir Aap key paas moazzin aaya aur Aap nikley aur namaz padhi aur wuzu na kya. (Bukhari: 698)"
"416","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namaz padhtey they, phir wapas jaatey aur apni qaum ko imamat karaatey. To unhon-ne Isha padhi aur Baqarah padhi. To aik aadmi (jamaat se) nikal gaya. To goya Muaz ne us se (narazgi ka) bartao kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Fitney mein daalney waley, fitney mein daalney waley, fitney mein daalney waley! Teen martaba. Ya farmaya: Fitna daalney wala, fitna daalney wala, fitna daalney wala! Aur unhey Mufassal key darmiyaan mein se do suratein (padhney) ka hukm diya. (Bukhari: 701)"
"417","[AI-translation] Abu Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main Subah ki namaz se peechey rehta hun fulaan ki wajah se jo hamein lambi (namaz) padhaata hai. To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko naseehat mein us din se zyada sakht ghusb mein nahi dekha. Phir farmaya: Beshak tum mein (logon ko) door bhagaaney waley hain. Phir tum mein se jo logon ko namaz padhaaey to use halki (namaz) padhaani chaahiye. Beshak un mein kamzor aur budha aur haajatmand hota hai. (Bukhari: 702)"
"418","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees (marwi hai) aur ke Nabi ne us se farmaya: To tum ne (Sabbihisma Rabbika) aur (Washshamsi wa Zuhaha) aur (Wallaili Iza Yaghsha) kyun na padhi. (Bukhari: 705)"
"419","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz halki aur poori kartey they. (Bukhari: 706)"
"420","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main namaz mein khada hota hun aur use lambi karna chaahta hun. Phir bachchey key roney ki aawaaz sunta hun to apni namaz halki kar deta hun, is naapasandgi se ke uski maan par mushakkat karun. (Bukhari: 707)"
"421","[AI-translation] Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum zaroor apni safein seedhi karogey ya Allah tumharey chehron key darmiyaan mukhaalifat daal dega. (Bukhari: 717)"
"422","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni safein seedhi karo aur mil kar khadey ho. Beshak main tumhey apni peeth key peechey se dekhta hun. (Bukhari: 719)"
"423","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ko apne hujrey mein namaz padhtey they. Aur hujrey ki deewaar chhoti thi. To logon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka saaya dekha. To log uthay aur Aapki namaz key sath namaz padhney lagey. To subah hui aur unhon-ne uskey baarey mein baat ki. To Aap doosri raat uthay. To Aap key sath log uthay aur Aapki namaz key sath namaz padhney lagey. Unhon-ne do ya teen raatein aisa kya. Yahan tak ke uskey baad jab hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baith gaey aur na nikley. Phir jab subah hui to logon ne uska zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak mujhey khauf hua ke tum par raat ki namaz farz kar di jaaeygi. (Bukhari: 729)"
"424","[AI-translation] Aur is hadees mein Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat se izaafa hai ke unhon-ne farmaya: Main ne jo tumhara kya dekha use pehchaan liya hai. To namaz padho ae logon apne gharon mein. Beshak afzal namaz aadmi ki apne ghar mein namaz hai, farz key siwa. (Bukhari: 731)"
